# Opening errands, independently checked against the original Gateway.
# One menu directive sends five individual PV keys without Enter.
COMMAND take debit card
COMMAND put debit card in pv slot
MENU_KEYS 1,N,N,0,0
ASSERT_LOCATION 126 d3
ASSERT_LOCATION d3 ee
LABEL pv_messages_read
COMMAND open drawer
COMMAND take book
COMMAND read book
COMMAND east
COMMAND northwest
COMMAND give book to receptionist
ASSERT_LOCATION d3 ec
ASSERT_LOCATION 123 0
ASSERT_LOCATION 130 d3
LABEL office_book_exchange
